<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Zekkaryaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekkaariyaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekkaaryaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zek.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zekkaaryaasikaa Raaga</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wabeekichchi Zekkaariyaasiki Maxaaf lame kutuwwaa'ni dhaabemeekeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hafuura adhdha 1-8 qico'ni; Kiristoosixxe ileensha edi darre onde dhibbanna lame tommenaa'ni onde dhibbanna tommenna saddeeta wogga qico'ni hexxeexxe wogguwwa giddo gargaritti hexxeexxe yannuwwaa'ni wabeekichchi Zekkaariyaasi haaso'eeki raagiink hiyyichchuwwi waleellatixxe bifanni shiqeeke kada wodda Iyyerusaalemii'i qammachchatixxee'e, galma haroba ijaaratixxee'e, Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ardixxe qulloomaxxeenna edi'a dagaake ookkone hariiremeekike barixxee'e kulaakeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hafuura adhdha 2:9-14 qico'ni, hexxeexxi kuta hekki hiyye kulemeeka raagiinka hiyyichcho abiddeexxeni; kunni raagiink hiyyichchuwwi haaso'a'neeki edi'a daga'neeke ookkone hariiremeekixxenna muuxamake'n murenda'neexxe murtexxeeteni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Taakkaxxi waleella, Fadhadokanna fadhado gulufeeka manna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Langaxxi waleella, horiinka gaafuwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 1:18-21">1:18-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sakkaxxi waleella, Miketixxe wodaroxxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sholgaxxi waleella, wabeekichchi Zekkaariyaasi qeesetixxee uudeexxa waleella <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ondixxi waleella, xasiinka ofo'limalchixxeenna ejersiinxe zayitexxee <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 4:1-14">4:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jiyaxxi waleella, Phirsaake mirqisanjo maxaafixxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 5:1-4">5:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Torbaxxi waleella, qiricco giddo hexxeexxa manjichcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 5:5-11">5:5-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saddeetixxi waleella, shoole sarageelluwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 6:1-8">6:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyaasu hariireme moyaashsha assatee uwwemeeka ajaja <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 6:9-15">6:9-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni dhugaatixxe kaddebaaxxa agabo goddo hosa adhdhabaaxxe kaddeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 7:1-7">7:1-7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ajajema gopha booji'enshatee buutote kaddeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 7:8-14">7:8-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni Iyyerusaalemixxee uwweexxa addachchiisa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 8:1-23">8:1-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageni arda ifika anjiraaxxanna naapha insa'neka mura woxxisaaxxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 9:1-11:3">9:1—11:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lame Isira'eelika akeekisanjuwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 11:4-17">11:4-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyerusaalemixxa Injifachcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 12:1-9">12:1-9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ardi bagedik otemeeke'e yaadexxanna Gootinba'a illee iima higeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10-13:9">12:10—13:9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxamiinka bagedonna Goottiinxa injifachcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 14:1-21">14:1-21</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ardi Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a Higo'aa Shiqeeka Ye'injo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Daariyoosi moyeexxe langaxxe wogga'n saddeetike agenjo'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi Beraakiyu Adoke belto'ni wabeekichcho Zekkaariyaasi'n hiyya'ni dagee qici: <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />«Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edike annuwwa ha'nooke'n yo'oshsha mufateemman. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Tennee ardake'n kul: Lumok Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: ‹Anibaa higge,› hiyya'neeni Lumoki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, ‹Aninna ha'nooba higannon,› hiyya'neni Lumok Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Edixxi wabeeko, annuwwa insa'neekee hite lallabbeemma qici: Lumoki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: ‹Fuggoke ornaa'ninna fuggoxxe ha'nooxxe hujenaa'n higge.› Yaane kinni insa'neexxa lanqeba'a ani hiyyennexxanna lanqeba'a, ha'no insa'neeshsha kaddinoqqe'e hiyya'nee'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Ha'nook annuwwi ta'a haba hedhetaa? Wabeeko duuchchi woddi'a hexxaata? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Ani'a ergatenda'neexxe wabeeko'n ajajanneki anki hiyyichchinna seeri anki ha'nooke annuwwa'n kadebaata?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">«Insa'nenna aadde angeexxi hinee qici, ‹Lumok Duuchchi Woddik Gootti muremmashshanni huje no'oxxishshanna me'inji no'okishsha no'o'n asseexxi seeraken.› »<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barseneetike Haqichchuwwixxe Oddo'n Uurreeka Manjichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Daariyoosi moyeexxe langaxxe wogga'n Sabaaxxi hiyyemaake tommenna mittike agenjixxe lame tommenna sholgaxxe barra'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hiyyichchi Beraakiyu Adoke belto'ni raagichcho Zekkaariyaasi'n dage.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Hashshati waleella uudenne: ookkonna ani edi darre'n mitti manjichchi diimmoka fadhachcho gulufeexxi dhooqa giddo Barsaneeti hiyyemmaake haqichuwwixxe oddo'n uurre'emman; isi udumii'ninna diimmok, boorajichchinna gola'laak fadhadi hedhemman.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Aninna isoo «Koo aadi kunnichchi maachcho hiyye qorenne?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Aninni haaso'ammaak iimik erganjinna «kunni maachcho kadeexxa ate'n leellishannon» hiyye. <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Baarseneeti hiyyemaake haqichchuwwixxe oddo'n uurreemmaki manjichchi ane'ni «Kunniiri butta duuchcha'n mammaremo'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ergeeke mannani» hiyye. <verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Insa'nenna Barsaneti hiyyemaake haqqichchuwixxe oddo'n uurre'emmake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike iimike erganjo'n «No'o butta duuchcha'n mammaremmennen; butta duuchchanna nage'ik sammi hitee hexxeen» hiyye haaso'e.<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimki erganji «Lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa konne torbaane tomme wogga itti mufattetteke Iyyerusaalemikenna Yihudake qachchuwwi'a marartabexxok haani qici'ate?» hiyye. <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti aninni haaso'ammake iimike erganjo'n gammachchiisaakanna jajjabeessaaka haaso'a haaso'e.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Ookkonneechchi uduma aninni haaso'aammak iimiki erganji anee hiyyee qici, «Konnee hiyyichcho ardakee lallabi: Lumoki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: ‹Ani Tsiyooni'anna Iyyerusaalemi'a lumo qici'a hinaafaannen. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Yaane kinni nage'ik hedheeke gosa gosake arda'n lumo qico mufate'ennen. Ani heeno qico mufateennan insa'ne kinni anke arda'n rakko bira sa'issine.›<verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />«Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: ‹Ani mararteti Iyyerusaalemi'a higannon: ookkonna mini ank qammachchemaani: mikatixxa wodaronna Iyyerusaalemi iima ibinsaan› hiyya'neen Lumoki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />«Higgeenn hita'ni lallabbatto qici: Lumik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici: ‹ank qachchuwwi haaroba durummat celqe hiyyaan: Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Tsiyooni'i haaroba jajjajbeessaan; haarobanna Iyyerusaalemi'i fi'laan› » hiyyi.<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shoole Gaafuwanna Shoole Angatixxe Ogeka Manna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Ookkonneechchi uduma iimi'a uudenne wodda ani edi darree'n shoole gaafuwwa uudenne! <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Aninni haaso'ammaka iimika erganjonna, «Kunni gaafuwwi maachcho?» hiyye hiisse qorenne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Isinna ane'n, «kunni Yihuda'a Isira'eelinna Iyyerusaalemii'i xeereeke gaafuwwan» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti shoole angatixxe ogeka manna ane'n leellishe. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Aninna, «Kunniiri maa asso'a dage'ekera?» hiyyenne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">Isinna ane'n, «Kunni gaafuwwi ayyinna umo ifika qokki assabaa qico'n Yihuda xeere'eeken; kunni angatixxe ogeki manni dage'echchi kinni Yihudaka boga balleesseexxi arda giddika xeereemmaka gosa gosaka arduwwa bararasseexxi gaafuwwa insa'neekanna enqe ibiso'aten» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Miketixxa Wodaro Abixxeeka Manjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Ookkonneechchi uduma ille anxa iimi'a ke'isse afenne, angate'ni miketixxa wodaro abixxeeka manjichch ani edi darre uudenne. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Aninna isoo, «Haba martaate?» hiyye qorenne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">Isinna hiisseexxi, «Iyyerusaalemik qeerrinninna godobi hittee qico kadeexxa mikonna'a me'aannen» hiyye. <verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Ookkonneechchi uduma aninni haaso'ammak iimik erganji edi'a sa'e me'e: weli iimik erganji isinni afemo'a dage. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Isinna isoo hiyyee qici: «Gongite martettexxi ookkonee, dargaggeesa manjo hitatto qici, ‹Iyyerusaalemike qachcha'n hedheeke ardiinxenna horiinxe birasa'nenaa'ni kexxeexxa Iyyerusaalemi dalla'a afebaake qachcha kaddaani. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Ani umo ankenninni qarqra iseke'n giiratike dalla'a kadannon› hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. ‹Ise giddonna gaachchanna iseke kadannon.›<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />«Ani ha'noo shooliinge kassixxe diidalloshsha xeereennan» hiyya'nen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. Ta'a kinni «Amme! Amme! Middike boganaa'n kexxine baajjine fulle» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />«Tee Tsiyooni amo; Baabiloonixxe beltonn welt hexxaattexxee baaji» <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Lumok Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'nee qici «Isi anee ulfeesseexxi ha'noo saameemmake gosa gosake arda'n anee ergeechchi uduma; ha'noo tuqeeki isixxe illeka gummichcho tuqeeken. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Aninna anga anxa insa'ne'ni wirri assannon insa'nek garbinna insa'nee saamaan; ookkonneechchi uduma ha'nonna Lumoki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anee ergeexxa egendinaan.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />«Tee Tsiyoonixxe belto ani dagennexxi atixxe oddo'n hedhaannaxxee'e ililisi, gammadi» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />«Eettene barra heddi gosa gosak arduwwi, Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa dageexxi arda anke kadaan; aninna oddo ha'nooxxe'n hedhannon: ha'nonna Lumok Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ha'noobaa ergeexxa egendinaan. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti woyyichcha boga'n Yihuda ifike qadaada assedhaan; Iyyerusaalemiinna higgeenni fi'laan. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti woyyichcha ifike galdumanaa'ni ke'eemaxxee koo manjiinke belto isi edo sammi hiyyi.»<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Qeesetike Akeekisanji'a Kaddaaxxa ca'itte Seemma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Ookkonneeechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti qeesoletika akeekisanjo Iyyaasuu Duuchchi Woddike Goottike iimike erganji edo uurreena'a, durriisikinna isoo ku'lo'a middi darre'n uurree'naa ane'n leellishe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:2">Izr. 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:10">Wal. 12:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna durriisa «Koo duriisa Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atee xixo'o: Iyyerusaalemi'i fi'leeki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atee xixo'o: isi kunni manjichchi giirati giddii'n butemeeke itisanjobaata?» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yih. 9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Iyyaasuunna xuritte seemma oddo'weexxi iimike erganji edo uurreemman. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Iimiki erganjinna isi edo ergataammakara, «Tennee xuritte seemma isonaa'n fulche» hiyye: ookkonneechchi uduma erganjikinna Iyyasuu'u «kunnise ani cubbo atixxa atenaa'n fuggusseenneni; eloxxa seemmanna ate'ni oddeessannoni» hiyye. <verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Aninna, «Isike umo'n ca'axxa ruufa ugge» hiyyeenne; Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki iimik erganji Iyyaasu bira uurree'naa umo isike'n ca'itte ruufa uggineexxi seemmatanna oddeessine. <verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji Iyyaasuu xexxe'achisa'n hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />«Lumok Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee'e hiyya'nee qici, ‹Ora anke'n me'itottole ajaja anka heqqexxottole, mine anka galchitattoni: anxe baxxuwwa'n akeekisanjoke assannoni; kaba uurreekirixxe oddo'ni bakka ati'a uwwannon.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />« ‹Koo qeesetike akeekisanjo Iyyaasuu laqi; kunni ati edo ofo'la'neeki atiki gargaarsanjuwwinna edi'a dagga'neexxe yaane'a beessisa kada'neeke manninna laqowwaal; Dame<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Erm. 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:15">33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:12">Zek. 6:12</ref>. </char></note> hiyyemeeka anka erganjo iyyedagannon. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Uuddi Iyyaasuu edo uggeenneka kinjoo! Ookkone mitte kinjo'ni hana torbaane ille hexxeeni; ookkonee kinjo'ninna borreessa qunqume giissannoni; konne bogixxa cubbonna mitte barra'n fugussannoni› hiyya'neni dada duuchcha ajajaki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />« ‹Eettene barra'ni mitti mittingi manji ifi ifike woyyinetikenna odi'iinke hiddichchi hudda ofo'lee olla'a ifika ye'eexxi itisaani› hiyya'neeni Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.»<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Xassiinka Worqetika Ofo'limalchonna Lame Ejersiinka Haqichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Ookkonneechchi uduma aninni welti haaso'a'ni hedhemmaki iimiki eriganji hige dageexxi manji mitti diiphokenaa'ni dammaqe ke'ammashsha anee dammase. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Isinna anee hiyye qoree qici, «Uuddaattechchi maachcho?» anee hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Aninna hiyye hiissennee qici, «Umoke'ni zayitetixxi odolcho hexxeka worqe callinni giissemeeka xassiinka ofo'lmalcho uudenneni; konne xassiinke ofo'lmalchi hana torbaane baanba afe'eeki torbaani xassuuwwi hedhemmani. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Higgeenna mitti eettenne zayitetixxe odolchobaa'ni middi daree'ni, welikinna bita'i darree'ni lami ejersiinki haqichchi hedheeni» hiyyene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Wal. 11:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Aninna anee haaseesaammaaka iimika erganjo hiyye qorenne qici, «Anke gootta, kunnichchiri maachcho?» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Isinna anee, «Maachcho kadeexxa egendebexxoo?» hiyye. Aninna iso'n, «Anke gootta; ege'nebe'no» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Tennexxee ane'ni hiyyee qici, «Zerubaabeli'a ergemeeki Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi, ‹Anke Hafuurinnite malee'e hunnatinna uududikitebaan› hiyya'neen Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />«Tee lumoxxe kooba atita maachcho? Zerubaabeli edo dirre bakka kaddatton; isinna cancik manni, ‹hittatta ela'ne! Hiyya'ni muuxamiinka kinjo uggaan.› »<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi ane'ni hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />«Zerubaabelixxi anga konne galmixxa booso dhaabbeeshshanni muuxaaxinna isinxe angan; Ookkonneechchi uduma lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ha'nooba'a erigeexxa egendinaani.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />«Shiixxoxxi yaane assendaaxxa barra tufateeki ayyeteta? Manni Zerubaabelixxe anga'ni miketixxa tunbi uudaa wodda gammadaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:10">«Tinni butta duuchcha'ni mammarendaaxxe Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe illenni.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Wal. 5:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Ookkonneechchi uduma aninna iimika erganjo, «Xassiinke ofo'lmalchike midda'ninna bita'a'ni hedheeki kunni lami ejeersiinki haqichchi maachcho?» hiyye qorenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Wal. 11:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Higeeni isoo, «Lame worqetike baanbi bira worqetixxi zayite isenaa'n dunenda'neexxi tinni lame ejersiinxi dame maachcho?» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Isinna anee'e, «Maachcho kandeexxa egendebexxoo?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Aninna iso'n, «Anke gootta; ege'nebe'no» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Isinna, ane'n «Kunni lami manni butta duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ergatemo'a harireme'eekeni» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Phirri Hiyyaaka Mirqisanjo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Higgeenna uudeenneni; ookkonna ani edo phir hiyyaaka mirqisanjo Maxaafa afenne. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Isinna, «Maachcho uuddaatte?» hiyye anee qore. Aninna iso'ni «Qeerrinni lame tomme ciqile, ba'linni tomme ciqile kadeeka phir hiyyaka mirqisanjo Maxaafa uudaanneni» hiyyenne. <verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Isinna ane'ni hiyyee qici, «Tinni butta duuchcha'ni daggaaxxe badinnon; mitte darre'ni boreesendemmashshani mooraaki duuchchi fuggussemaan; wele darre'ninna iittanni borreesendemmashshanni dhariki kakataaki duuchchinna fugussemaan. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti, ‹Ani badino idagannoni; tinni badinonna moodhalchiinke mine'ninna anke summinni dhariki kakataammake manjike mine'ni e'yitaani; ookkone mine'ninna hexxaan: mine isika, haqqetanna kino isike minixxa balleessitaan› » hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agalade Giddo Hexxeexxa Manjichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Ookkonneechchi uduma aninni welti haaso'a'ni hedhemmaki iimiki erganji anibaa dageexxi, «Iimi'a uudi; kunni daga'neechchi maachcho kadeexxa uudi» ane hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Aninna, «Maachcho?» hiyye qorenne. Isinna ane'ni, «Miketixxe agaladeni» hiyye. Higgeenna «Tinni butta duuchcha'ni hexxeexxe ardiinxe balleessan» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Ookkonneechchi uduma irsaase hiyyemaake sibiljik tuphanji baneme; miketixxe agalade giddonna mitte manjichcho ofoldeemmani. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Iimiki eriganjinna, «Tinni manjichcho fuggitetten» hiyyeexxi isee agalade giddi'a hiisseexxi irsaase hiyyemeeke sibljika tuphanjo agaladetike afo'o'ni tuphe.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Ookkonneechchi uduma iimi'a uudennen: kunse ani edi'ni lame melaalle hexxemmani: keeluwwa insa'neke'ninna diidallo hexxemaani: keeluwwi insa'nekinna waarrayyetike keelishsha hedhemmani; agaladetanna aa'neexxi iimi'a phirri hine.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Aninni welti haaso'ammaka iimika erganjonna, «Agalade haba'a adhdhine me'ina'ne?» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Isinna ane'ni, «Mine ise'a ijjaarro'a Babiloonike bogibaa adhdhine me'ina'neeni; mine ijjaarre bireechchi uduma agalade ookko ugginaani» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Shoole Sarageella</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Higgeenna iimi'a uudenneni: kunse shoole sarageellwwi lame koobaxxe oddonaa'ni fuldaa'naa uudenne; koobuwwatinna sageettotixxe koobuwwammani. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Siretika sarageella harkisaammaki diimmoke fadhadoman, langaka sarageella harkisaammaki fadhadi xilloke,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:4-5">Wal. 6:4-5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />Sakkaka sarageella harkisaammaki fadhadi golalooke kadaa wodda: shoolgaka sarageella harkisaammakinna taltallichcha fadhadommani: duuchchiingi jajjabbakemmani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2">Wal. 6:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Aninna aninni welti haaso'aammaka iimika erganjo, «Anke gootta kunnichchiri maachcho?» hiyyenne.<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Iimiki erganjinna ane'ni hiyyee qici, «Tinni buttatike Duuchchike Woddike Gootti edo uurrite hexxemmaxxe bakkanaa'ni fulda'neexxe iimatixxe shoole diidalluwani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Wal. 7:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Xillollami fadhadi harkisaammak sarageelli middik bogibaa, golallami fadhdhadi harkisaammak sarageelli dhidhimiinke bogibaa, taltallichchi fadhadi harksaammak sarageelli bita'ike bogibaa me'aammani.»<verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Iikki jajjabbi fadhadi me'aa wodda butta duuchcha qolchatee qixxeeffateemman. Isinna konnee fadho, «Bogi duuchchibaa me'e» hiyye; fadhadikinna boga duuchchibaa me'e.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Ookkonneechchi uduma iimiki erganji canca'ni ane'ni, «Middike bogibaa me'a'neekir hafura anka middike boga'ni anee hafuura adhdhise'een» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyasu'ni Uggemeeka Kallachcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi ane'ni hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />«Baabiloonike boganaa'ni booji'eme dageemmake Heldaayinaa'ni, Xoobbiyanaa'ninna Yidaa'iyanaa'ni worqetanna birreetika sibljo aadhi; eetteneenni barra Sofooniyaasika belto Iyyosiyaasiba mari. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Eettene worqenna birreetika sibljo aaxxetexxi kallachcha giissite Iyyooseedeqika belto Qeesetika akeekisaanjo Iyyaasuke umo'ni uggi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />Iso'ninna Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'neeni hite kuldato qici: ‹Kunse Summi Dame hiyyemeeki manji konneteni; isinna bakka ifixxe'ni barqaaqaani: Duuchchi Woddike Goottika galmanna ijaaraani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Erm. 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:15">33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:8">Zek. 3:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Galma ijaaraak isoteni. Isinna ulfeessemeeke kadaani. Mootete'ni ofo'leexxi moyaani; mootende'ni ofo'le qeesomaan; lamiinge baalloomixxe oddo'ni nage'i hedhaani.› <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Kunni kallachchinna Heeleemi'a, Xoobbiya'a, Yidaa'iya'anna Sofooniyaasika belto Heeni'a Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Galmi giddo qaabete kadaani. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Iikki bayya hedheeki manni dageexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Galmi ijaaremaa wodda gargaaraani; ha'nonna Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ha'noobaa ergeexxa egendinaani. Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'nooke Mageni'a xexxe'achchoti ajajendinoole tinni duuchcha kaddaani.»<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Dhugaatixxi Murtenna Mararte Eeyendeexxeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Moyaanji Daariyoosi moyeexxe shoolgaxxe wogga'ni Kaaseelu hiyyemaake sallanike agenjixxe shoolgaaxxe barra'ni Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi Zekkariyaasi'ni dage. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Beeteliki manni Saar'etseeriinna Regeemelekii'i mitteba hedhemmake manninni welti Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodanto'a ergine. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />Insa'nenna Lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Galmixxa qeesenna wabeeko hine qorree qici, «Ta'i qico'ni heddo wogga'ni assineennashsha ondike agenjo'ni yaanda'ni agabo goddo hosa no'o'a hasissaa?» hine qorre.<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Ookkonneechchi uduma lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi ane'ni dage hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />«Butta duuchchika ardanna qeesee hite qortatto qici, ‹Saxxeexxe torbaane tomme wogguwwake ondikenna torbake agenjo'ni agabo goddo hosinaammakinna yaaddinaammaaki dhugaanda ani'atemmata? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Itinna'ninna ha'witina'ni hexxinemmaki umo ha'nongeetemmabaata? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Iyyerusaaleminna qarqara iseke'ni hedheeki qachchuwwi duroome nage'iki hedhaa'naa bita'ikenna dhidhimiinke tulchuwwike kasuwwa'n manni hedhaamma wodda Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti edixxe wabeeko darree'ni haaso'emmaki haaso'i konnenidemmabaa?› »<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi higgeenna Zekkaariyaasi'ni dage'e hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />«Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, ‹Dhugaatixxa murte murre; weli'aanni weli marartine ba'latte. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Aro'o shi'witeexxa melaalle, yookaani annakanna ama afebaaxxa yookaan alaga, yookaani hiyyeessa rakkissinoqe'e; godoba ha'nooki giddonna mitti mittekee fuggoxxa hedinoqqe'e.›<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />«Yaane kinni insa'ne gooba micciidhdhine laqa ginbe; lanqabaashshanna dudduro wirri hine; manshatanna tuphe'ne. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Godoba ifikanna cabbetike kinjishsha jabeesse'ne; Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti edixxe wabeeko darree'ni ifike hafuurinni ergemaaka hiyyichcho yookaani seera lanqebaani; tennexxee Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti yo'oshsha mufate.<verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />« ‹Ani insa'nee ye'enne wodda laqebaani; tennexxee insa'nenna anee ye'ee'naa wodda laqabe'no› hiyya'neeni lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />‹Insa'ne egenebaake gosa gosake ardi giddo diidalloti insa'nee xexxeerenne; insa'ne uduma huuni manjinna ookko'a dagaakinna ookko'a maraaki hedhabaa qico'ni bogi insa'neki urumme gate; shamoka insa'neka boga urmake assennechchi tennexxeeteni.› »<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyerusaalemii Eebbiso'a Kako Aageeti Herregeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Higgeenni lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi anibaa dage. <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Ani Tsiyooni'a yo'oshsha hinaafenneni; ise'aanna hinaaffeti gubatteenn» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Ani Tsiyoonibaa higannon; Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedhannoni. Ookkonneechchi uduma Iyyerusaalemi Dhugaatike qachcha hiyyendaani; lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi Koobanna Woyyitte kooba hiyyendaani» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Geedhetinna higgeenni Iyyerusaalemixxe baxxe giddo ofoldaan; mitte mittendi geedhe cimotenaa'n kexxeexxa siqqo siqqexxa. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Qachchiinke oruwwa'ni ookko geebbaaxxe labbaaxxenna meyyaxxe oosenni wo'mitaani» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Ookkonne wodda gatemmake Isra'eelike ardi'a tennee jajaan; ani kinni tennee jajannota?» hiyya'neeni Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Ani, boroti darreke boga'ninna dhidhimini darreke boga'ni hedha'neeka arda anka anjirannoni. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Ani insa'nee Iyyerusaalemi he'no'aa wirri asse idagannon; insa'nenna anke arda kandaani; aninna qullummatinna addatenshati insa'neke Mageno kadannoni» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Galmixxi booso dhaabendaa wodda ookko hexxemmaaxxi raagole haasootteemmaka hiyyichcho ta'a laqqina'neeki duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Galma ijaartino'a hirre ha'nooxxa jabeesedhdhe. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Ookkonneechchi edgama manjokee rundi, horekeenna barra hujeek hiri, uwwemaammabaani; mitti mittingi manji olla'a ifinge'ni ke'aashsha assennexxee'e manji fule me'a woddanna aaga wodda nage'i hedhemmabaani. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Ta'a kinni edo asseennashsha konne gateeke arda'ni assabo'noni» hiyya'neeni lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />«Facaanseexxi sanne eloqico lattaani, woyinetiki hiddichchinna gumma gummisaani, buttinikinna midha uwwaani, iimuwwatenaa'ninna xeeni ganaani; konneechcho duuchcha gatemmake anke ardi'a geegoke asse uwwannoni. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Koo Yihudiinkenna Isira'eelike ardike mini hadoo; ha'noo gosa gosake ardi giddo badinemati mammaakendineemmakemman; ta'a kinni ani ha'noo anjirannoni; ha'nonna eebbisendinaani. Sodaatinoqqe; yaane kinni hirre ha'nooxxa jabeessedhdhe.»<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Ediki annuwwi ha'nooki anee mufachchiinsee wodda mararte mitte belo ba'ne insa'ne'ni idagonnaa mudhdheenani,» hiyya'neeni lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti. <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />«Ta'a kinni Iyyerusaalemi'anna Yihuda'a eloxxa yaane assonna'a mudhdhenneni; sodaattinoqqee. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Ha'no assa hasisaaxxi yaane konneechchinni butti'a hexxeeni: weli'aanni weli dhuggaa haaso'we; songote'ninna dhugaatixxa murte murre.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe. 4:25</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Olla'a ha'nookee fuggoxxa yaane godobi ha'nooki giddo heddinoqqe'e; dhariki kakata eetinoqqe; ani tennee duuchcha diqatannon» hiyya'neeni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Higgeenni lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi anibaa dage hiyyee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Sholgake agenjixxi agabo goddo hosa, ondike agenjixxi, torbakixxinna tommike agenjixxi agabo goddo hosa Yihudiinke ardi'a gammashshotike, fenxe hiyyatikenna ilileettetike ayyaanna kadaani; tennexxee dhugaatanna nage'a eeyye» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Heddi ardinna heddo qachchuwwik manni dagaaxxe yanna daggaan. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Mitte qachcha'ni hedhaammaki manni, ‹Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenooffantonnaa; lumoka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta halsinonnaa amme; ranke me'ino; aninna umi aninginninni me'aanneni› hina'ni wele qachchibaa me'aani. <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Heddi ardinna jajjabbi mootummuwwa Lumoka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta halsito'anna magenooffato'a Iyyerusaalemi'a daggaani» hiyye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, «Eettene barruwwa'ni gargari hexxeexxe gosak gargar hedheeke afo'inni haaso'aaki ardi tommi manni mitte Ayihudiinke manjichchixxe seemmaka handaara duudhe abixxeexxi ‹Mageni ha'nooni welti hedheexxa lanqeennaaxxee ha'nooni welti me'ino› » hiyyaani.<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelike Naapha'n Murendeexxa Murte</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi higgeenni Sediraake boga'n dirraan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">Demasiqo'ninna muraan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">Manniinxinna Isira'eelike gosa gosati minixxi ille duuchchi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a uuddaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:1-3">Isa. 17:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Erm. 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo. 1:3-5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Ittanni kunn murtetiki hiyyichchi gabalate'ni hexxeexxi Hamaati'ninna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">yo'osha beekkuma afeeke Xiroosikenna Sidoonake qachchuwwa'ni geyaani.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Xiroosi ifi'a kollo giissexxe'eeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">birretika sibljonna bukotishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">worqetanna ori giddixxe dhoqqeshsha tuu'lite'eeni.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni karra isexxa isenaa'ni adhdhaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">lumoxxe abbaayya'ni afeexxa hunna isexxa enqaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">iseenna giira ite'na'a bululoke kaddaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa. 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hiz. 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat. 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luq. 10:13-14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Asiqeloona tennee uudeexxi sodaattaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaazanna rakkatte wixxirri hitaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Aqarooninna iittanni waye uudaani; addattaachchinna gophemaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaaza moyanjo iseka gophphaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Asqeloona urmake kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Isa. 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Erm. 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Hiz. 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo. 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Sof. 2:4-7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Ashidoodi giddo gargari hedheeki ardi karseme ofo'laani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">Filisixxeemitotixxa hollanna balleessannoni.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Ani munde afo'o insa'neekenaa'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">batto'echchonna qeqqeshsha insa'neeki giddii'ni fulchannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">hafe ganteeki no'oke Magenike arda kandaani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Yihudake'ninna akeekisanjuwwake kandaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">Aqarooninna Iyyaabusitotishsha kaddaani.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Ani kinni mine anka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">hunnati saamammake mannanaa'ni heqqedhdhannoni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Anka arda miince'e hirbeessinabaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">ta'a yooni jaba qicinni heqqannon.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsiyoonike Moyanjixxa Daga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Tee Tsiyoonixxe belto; yo'oshsha gammadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Tee Iyyerusaalemixxe belto; ililisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Kunna'a, qullichchikinna anjiralli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">moyanji atik, shaqqake kadee harre gulufeexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">harretixxe beltanjo hana ofo'lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">atibaa dagaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:5">Mat. 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:15">Yoh. 12:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Ani loliinxa fadhadiinxa gaarruwwa Efireeminaa'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">loliinka fadhaduwwa Iyyerusaaleminaa'ni fugussannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">loliinxi gabenna enqendaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Isi gosa gosake ardi'a nage'a lallabaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">galcha isixxinna lumoxxe abbaayanaa'ni abbaayyati qico'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Galaanakenaa'ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaalaan kunni Efiraxisike galaanan</char></note> bogiinxe gabala qico'ni ba'lattaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:8">Far. 72:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Ati'a kinni, ati'a aagennexxe mundetixxe kakonaa'ni kexxeexxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">usuremeemmaka atika manna wodi'i hedhemmabaaxxe balenaa'ni qullo fulchannoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Fula. 24:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Ha'no usurendineexxi halchati hexxina'neeke kollo ha'nooxxibaa higge:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">ta'atenna kaddoole lame anga asseennexxi ha'no'a hiissannoxxa kulaanneni.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Gabe anxa dobenneshsha Yihudaa dobannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">Isira'eelinna mogidiinsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">Girkeeka manna lolakee'e la'oonfatannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Tee Tsiyooni, oose atixxa lolakee'e ke'issannoni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">koo Girikeke mannaa, atixxe oose'ni ke'naashsha assannoni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">loliinke manjike wolaantichchishsha atee assannoni.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Ifi Leellisha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'ne'n leellaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">mogidik isikinna banqotishsha xalaqisaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni malagata ufuufaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">bita'ixxe hobonbalte giddo me'aani.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna insa'nee gollaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">insa'nenna naapha ifika shinnaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">kinjinxe looyyanninna injifantaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Ha'winaani; woyinetixxe bookanni machcho'eeke manjishsha cancinaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">tolchimalchiinke kasuwwa'ni fiffixxatee qophpho'eemmake miyishsha:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">insa'nenna iittanni wo'mine'een.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Arda ifika horiinke bobba'ishsha assedheexxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">eettene barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'neeki Mageni insa'nee anjiraani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Kallachchi hana hedheeke fiixeeke kinjishsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">isike boga'ni warawara hinaani.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Hittatta danchoomeekenna mambe'a hinaake kandaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">midha dargaggeeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">reefixxi woyinetixxi bookanna, oosettanna melaalle nophphitaashsha assitaani.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Yihuda'a Xexxe'ataani</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti midha wiilsatixxe yanna'ni xeena ha'no'a uwwaashsha soodatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">xeenika duumaancha idagaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Isi mannakee geyaaka xeena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">mitte mittengee buttatika hiddichcho uwwaan.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Fakkuwwa manjo dedhissaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">moraammak manni dhariinxe waleella uudaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Sobiinxa oojjonna haaso'aani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">woyi fuldabaaxxa jajjabeessa jajjabeessaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Tennexxee ardi gedhebiinsha doonsa kiyya hiyyaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">allalisanjo gophatinna rakkateeni.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />Mufe anxi allalisanote'ni bubbeeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">akeekisanjuwwakanna xixannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Hore ifike Yihudake ardi'a xexxe'ataani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">lolliinxe yanna'ninna hollisaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">fadhachchishsha insa'nee assaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Yihudanaa'n dhaaddoti kinji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">duunkaaniinxi kaaso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">Loliinxi gabenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">galchalluwwi duuchchi dagaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Mitteba loliinke sannachcha kandaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">naapha orgi giddixxe dhoqqeshsha hirbeessinaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'nenni welti hedhemmaxxee'e lolleexxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">fadhadiki lolammaka manna salphinsaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />«Ani Yihudaka arda jajjabeessannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">Yoossefika ardanna anjirannoni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">Insa'ne'a mararaannaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Insa'neexxe bakkabaa insa'nee hiissannoni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">insa'nenna ani gibebe'noke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">manna kandaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootta insa'neeke Mageno kadeennaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">soodachcho insa'neexxa laqannoni.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Efireemito jajjabba manna kaddaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">qalbe insa'neexxinna woyinetixxa booka ha'weeke manjishsha gammaddaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Oose insa'nexxinna tennee uuda'ni gammaddaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">qalbe insa'nexxinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ni gammaddaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Fiissa'nee insa'nee ye'annon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">mitteba bukki assannoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Dhugaaten, insa'nee anjirannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">edishshanni laakkoosi insa'neeki bira sa'aani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Gosa gosake ardi giddo insa'nee xeeroonnolenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">bayyike boga'ninni he'ne anee kassi hinaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Insa'nenna oose insa'nexxi lubbondinni he'ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">bogi ifikibaa hingaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Gibtseeke boganaa'ni insa'ne hiissannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">Asooriinaa'ninna insa'nee bukki assannoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Gele'adiba'anna Libaanoosiba'a insa'ne iyyedagannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">insa'ne'a geyaak boonchinna afemabaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Insa'nenna rakkotixxe abbaayya giddii'ni sa'naani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">abbaayyatiki danbala'inna sammi hiyyaani:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Abbaayike Galaaniinxi dhi'mo duuchchi baggaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Ifi dhaadammaxxi Asoorixxi kijibanna salphattaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Gibtseexxi mootummanna hunna gophphaani.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Ani Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti insa'ne jajjabeessannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">summa isikenninna mammaremmaani»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">hiyya'neeni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Koo Libaanoosi; birbirsa atika giira itto'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">huluwwa atixxa bani!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Koo hi'neesiinke haqichcho birbirsiink haqichchi ibeemmaaxxee oodhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">ulfeessemeemmaki haqichchuwwinna ba'eeni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Koo Baasani qilxuwwa oodhdhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">jabaki gongomi worqeme'een!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Allalisanotixxa raare laqqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">ulfinni insa'neeki adhdhemeemmaxxee'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Neeniinxa harqa caqasse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">jabak Yordaanoosike gongomiki baabi kutti hiyyeen.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lame Allalisano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anki Mageni hiyya'nee qici: «Dulokee foyemeeka gedhebo bobbaasi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Hidhdhemmaaki manni konnee gedhebo dulaani; insa'neenna xixxaaki hedhebaani: gurguremaaki manninna, ‹Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galati gewo'o: dureessake kadeenneni!› hiyyaani. Konne gedhebixxi allalisanonna midde gedhebokee marartabaani. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Ta'inni elqi'a ani buttate'ni hedha'neeke ardi'a mararabe'noni» hiyya'neeni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti. «Manjo duuchcha olla'a isikixxe'ninna moyanjiinxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwannoni; insa'nenna butta rakkinsaani; aninna anga insa'nexxeenaa'ni insa'ne anjirabo'noni.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Tennexxee dulemo'a fooyemeemmaka gedhdhebo, giddii'ninni miicemeemmaka gedhebo allalannoni; Lame siqqo aadhennexxi mitte «Danchitte» langaxxanna «Mittumma» hiyye summa fulchennexxi horekanna bobbaaseenneni. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Mitte agenji giddo sasiinxa allalisano fugussenneni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 11:8">Gedhebikinna anee gibe; aneenna gophise.<verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Aninna konnee gedhebo, «Ani ha'noke allalisanjo kadabe'no; reyaaki reyowwaali: ba'aakinna ba'owwaali: gateekirinna mitti mittiinka maala itowwaali» hiyyeenneni.<verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Ookkonneechchi uduma gosa gosake ardi duuchchinni welti aageennaxxa kako diigatee «Danchitte» hiyye summa fulcheennaxxa anxa siqqichcho aadheennexxi enqeenneeni; <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Eettene barra'ni kako diigende; ane'e uuda'ni hedheemmakirinna wixixxi hiyyeemaki gedhebinna kunni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichcho kadeexxa ege'ne.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Aninna insa'nee, «Eloxxe fakkaatte ha'no'ni leellita'noole runda anka ani'a uuwe; uwwa gophphina'noole waalle» hiyyenneni; tennexxee sase tomme birretika sibiljo ane'n uune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:15">Mat. 26:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna anee hiyyee qici, «Ani'a uuno'a weli angeeka eloka hira odolcho ganammak manjichcho'n darbi» hiyye. Tennexxee aninna sase tomme birretika sibiljo aadhenneexxi odolcho ganaammake manjichcho'n darbenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:9-10">Mat. 27:9-10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Isira'eelixxanna Yihudixxa dayyumma diigatee «Mittumma» hiyye summa fulcheennaxxa langaxxa siqqichcho enqeenneni.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna anee hiyyee qici, «Higgeenna gowwa allalisanjika miya adhdhi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Kunse ani buttate'ni allalisanjo ke'issannoni: isinna ba'eekee xexxe'atabaani: ba'eeka hasabaani: enqemeeka xaasabaani: fayyeeka itisabaani; yaane kinni isi ha'yeemmakike maala itaani; mannetinna gattebaangi ite biraani.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />«Hore allalabaake woyi fulabaake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">allalisanji'a isi'a aanne'e!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Wolaantichchi ciqiletanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">middixxa isixxa ille otowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">hirre isixxi hara xuuxxendowwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">middixxi isixxi ille ijje baxxowwaali.»<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyerusaalemiki Naaphuwwi Kutti Hiyyaaxxa Kulemeeka Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Isira'eelixxe kulemeeki Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki hiyyichchi konneechchinni butti'a hedheeni; iimuwwa dhiseeki, buttatixxa boosonna dhaabeek, manjoke'ni hedhotika hafuura giddo uggeek, Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hiyya'nee qici, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />«Ani Iyyerusaalemii'i qarqara iseke'n hedheek ardi duuchchi isenaa'n ha'weexxi gatantaraaxxe buuda assanon; Yihuda Iyyerusaalemishshanni elqe kayyii'ni buqendaani. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Eettene buttatiki gosa gosaki ardi duuchchi Iyyerusaalemi'ni bukki hiyyaaxxe barra'ni, Iyyerusaalemii'i gosa gosaki ardi duuchchi'a le'mitabaaxxe rassa assanoni; isee le'miso'aa wo'lanaaki duuchchinna ifi'aanni miidhemaani. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Eettene barra mitti mittinga fadhado alayyik, gulufeemmaka mannanna maraatummati ganannon» hiyya'neeni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti. «Yihudaka arda ille anxenni heqqannon; yaane kinni gosa gosake ardike fadhadixxa ille balleessannon. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Yihudaki akeekisanjuwwi ifike godobi giddo ‹Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageno insa'neeke kadeemmaxxee Iyyerusaalemik ardi jabakeni› hiyyaani.<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />«Eettenee barra Yihudaka akeekisanjuwwa giiratixxe boosumma hana tuullee'naa ha'yitammaxxe haqqeshsha, midhatixxe ladde giddonna ha'yammake xassa insa'nee assannoni; middii'ninna bita'ii'ni qarqara insa'neeke'ni hedheeka gosa gosaka arda indaan; yaane kinni Iyyerusaalemi bakka ifixxenaa'ni mishikki hitabaani.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />«Daawwitiki ardikinna Iyyerusaalemi hedha'neeke manniki ulfinni, Yihudake ulfinninaa'ni sa'abaashsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti sirete'ni Yihudake ardika galduma anjiraani. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Eettene barra ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedha'neeke manni'a wontete kaddanon; insa'nee giddii'ni gophaaleessi Daawwitishsha kadaan; Daawwitiki ardinna Mageniisha kadaan; insa'nee edo me'ammake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike iimik erganjishshanna kadaan. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Eettene barra Iyyerusaalemii'i loleemmaka gosa gosaka arda duuchcha bironna'a ke'aannoni.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onteemmakee'e Assendeexxa Yaaddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />«Daawwitike arda'ninna Iyyerusaalemi hedha'neeke arda'ni badhaadhakanna soodachchotika hafuura insa'nee giddo uggannoni; anee onteemmakanna uundaan. Insa'nenna mittelchokee'e oo'nammashsha isi'a oo'naani; angafi belti'a hiiqqinse oo'nammashshanna isi'anna hiiqqinse oo'naani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:37">Yoh. 19:37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Wal. 1:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Eettene barra Megidoonike diidaa'ni Hadaadi Riimooni'a oodhishsha kaddeemmashsha Iyyerusaalemi giddonna iittanni lumoxxi oodhishsha kaddaan. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Buttatinna ooxxaani; mitte mitte gosake minik labballi ifi ifi'aanni oodhaani: aruwwa insa'neexxinna ifi ifi'aanni ooxxaani: tenne bifanni Daawwitixxe gosake minik labballi aruwwa ifixxinni, Naataanixxe gosake minik labballi aruwwa ifixxinni, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />Leewwixxe gosake minike hadiki labballi aruwwa ifixxinni, Shimi'ixxe gosak labballi aruwwa ifixxinni, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Gateek gosa gosake minik labballi duuchchinna aruwwa ifi ifixxinni oodhaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat. 24:30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Wal. 1:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s1">Cubbotenaa'ni Ca'a Hiyya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />«Eettenne barra Daawwitika ardanna Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedha'neeka arda battoomakenaa'ninna cubbotenaa'ni ca'a assitaaxxi muume banendaani.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />«Ani eettenee barra magenoofantaammaxxe fakkuwwaka summa buttatenaa'ni balleessannoni» hiyya'neeni Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti. «Ani wabeekonna fuggichcha hafuura bogakenaa'ni fugussannon. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Huuni manjinna raaga haaso'oole i'leemaki anninna ama isixxi, ‹Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni dhara haasottettaxxee reyo ati'a haasissaan› isoo hinaan. Isi raaga haaso'oolenna isingi hadi isoo otee shiyaani.»<verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />«Eettenee barra mitti mittiniigi wabeekichchi haaso'aaxxe raagiinxe waleellaxxee shookaani. Manna sobo'anna wabeekotixxa ordatixxa seemma odo'wabaani. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Isinna, ‹Ani fichcha huccaa'ni galannoke malee wabeekichchokebaani; ani oosummandenaa'ni galdumi anki fichcha huccaten› hiyyaani. <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Mitti manji, ‹Tinni biso atike'ni hexxeexxi mada mayiinxe?› hiyye isoo qoroole, ‹anke jaaluwwike mine'ni hedheenna wodda mado'ennexxe madani› hiyyaani.»<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Allalisanji ganeme, Gedhebikinna Xeereme</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />«Koo wolaantichcha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ankee allalisanjo'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">anke shiqike jaalo'ni ke'i!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">hiyya'neen Lumoki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">«Allaalisanjo gani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">gedhebikinna xeeremaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">aninna hirre anxa shixxarammake'n wirri assannoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:31">Mat. 26:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27">Mar. 14:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Bogi giddo duuchcha'n hedheeke ardinaa'n» hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">«Sase anganaa'ni lame anga ganemee reyaani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">sase anganaa'ni mitte anga kinni isi giddonni gataani.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Tenne sasenaa'ni mitte kuta giiratibaa iyyedagannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">birretike sbiljishsha insa'nee qorqorsisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">worqetishshanna insa'nee hega uudannoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Insa'nenna anka summa ye'enaani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">aninna insa'ne'a hee hiyyannon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Aninna, ‹insa'nee anke ardani,› hiyyannoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">insa'nenna anee'e, ‹Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageno no'okeni hinaani.› »<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Dageexxi Moyaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Kunse Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi barra daggaani; eettenee barra atenaa'ni saammeemmalchonna ati giddo qooddemmaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Ani Iyyerusaalemii lollo'a gosa gosaka arda duuchcha bukki assannoni; qachchakanna abindaani: minuwwakanna saammaan: melaalletanna hunnati abindee diinphaani: insa'nenna qachchiinke gamisika manna boojinaan; gataaki ardi kinni qachchakenaa'n adhdhemmabaan.<verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna loliinxe yanna'ni lolammashsha ookkonee gosa gosaka arda lolo'a fulaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Eettenee barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyerusaalemii'ni boroti darre'ni hexxeexxe Dabire Zayitexxe kooba hana uurraani: Dabire Zayitexxi koobanna lumoxxe dhooqa kadati koobatika gamisa middi darre'ni, gamisaakanna bita'i darre'ni gatteexxi borotixxenna dhidhimiinxe kaddeexxi lamebaa fuldaan. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Ha'noonna kooba lameba shatte'e Atsaali qico'ni gelteexxe tenne dhooqa giddii'ni baqattinaan: Yihudaka moyanjo Ooziyaake baro'ni butta lele'mitee wodda ediki annuwwi ha'nooki baqatemmashsha baqattinaani: ookkonneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anki Mageni dagaani; woyyoole isixxi duuchchinna isinni welti daggaani.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Eettenee barra kaade, qorrikinna ifi hedhabaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Itti Barranna ifi yookaani dukkana hexxebaaxxe gargari hexxeexxe barra kaddaani: itti barra Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ni ege'nendeexxe barra kaddaani; bogi hashshoolenna ifake kadaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Eettenee barra hedhotiki wodi'i Iyyerusaaleminaa'ni phu'ise yaa'aani: gamisi boroti darrexxe Maxxinetixxe abbaayyabaa, gamisikinna dhidhimii darrexxe Lumoxxe Abbaayyabaa ya'aani; tinninna haarso bono kaddaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:38">Yoh. 7:38</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Wal. 22:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti butta duuchcha'ni moyaani: eettenee barra Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti mitteke, summi isikinna mitte calla kadaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Butta duuchcha Gebaan Iyyerusaalemike bita'akenaa'ni saxxeexxi Rimoonii qico'ni jijjiirende Arebake diidishsha kaddaani. Yaane kinni Iyyerussaalemi Biniyaamixxe hulabaa'ni siretixxe hulaa qico'ni, kasiinxe hulabaa'ninna Hanaani'eelike kinjiinke dalla'ibaa'ni moyanjokee woyine miincammake boonchi qico'ni ookkone iseke booncho'ninni lummeexxeshshanni hexxaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Iyyerusaalemi ardiinke galduma kaddaani: haranga langaxxa diigendabaani; mitte soda'a belonna nage'iki hexxaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:3">Wal. 22:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Iyyerusaalemi'i loleemmaka gosa gosaka arda duuchcha balati ganaa qici konneechchi butta hexxeeshshate: reefi lekkati uurrinnaa wodda maali insa'neki alo'aani: ille insa'nexxi gaari giddonni hexxe aloottaani; arrabi insa'nekinna afo'i giddonni alo'aani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Eettenee barra Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'ni jabaxxi weekensha kaddaan: mitti mittingi mannji ifike jaalixxa anga abida'n lolaan. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Yihudaki ardi kinni Iyyerusaalemii'i lolaani. Iseke qarqara'ni hedheek gosa gosake ardixxi karra, heddo worqe, birretik sibljinna seemma bukki assendaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Tenneenni fakkaattaaxxi bala fadhado, gaange, gaaluwwakanna harre iittanni olla'a olla'a'ni hedheeka hore duuchcha gandaani.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Iyyerusaalemii'i lole miidheemmake gosa gosake ardinaa'ni reyotenaa'ni gateemmak duuchchi Lumoka moyanjo Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenooffato'aanna fooqiinka ayyaanna ulfeesso'a wogga wogga'ninni alalle qabataani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">Lew. 23:39-43</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Buttatiki ardi duuchchi ookkonee Lumoka moyanjo, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoofato'a Iyyerusaalemi'a allalle qabateexxi daga gophoole xeeni insa'ne'a ganabaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Gibtseeki manninna allalle qabate marebaaki gatoole xeeni insa'neba ganabaani; alalle qabateexxi fooqiinka ayyaana ulfeessabaake gosa gosake arda'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti geessisaammaxxa bala insa'ne'ninna geesisaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Fooqiinka ayyaanna alalle qabate ulfeessabaake Gibtseeke arda'ninna gosa gosake arda duuchcha'n muremeeki xixichchi konnete.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Eettenee barra fadhadiinke gooba'ni rarraansammake bilbili hana «Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyoomeeke» hiyyaaki borreesi borreessemaani; Duuchchi Woddike Goottike mine'ni hexxeexxi woyi ganfaaxxi odolchuwwa tolchi malchi edo hexxeexxe qoruwwashshanni woyyondeexxe kaddaani. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Iyyerusaalemi giddonna Yihudake'ni hexxeexxi odolchuwwa duuchchi Lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a woyyoondeexxe kaddaani; tolcha tolcho'a dagaaki duuchchi eettene odolchuwwa adhdha'ni itti galfaani; eettenee barra Lumoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottike mine'ni ookkonneechchi uduma Kanaanito afendabaani.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>